    "title": "It's no longer easy being an Angular front-end dev in 2026: why the market wants fullstack",
    "description": "I was told: if you'd been fullstack, we'd have kept you. The story of a lost mission, the 2026 French Angular market in numbers, and what it changes for pure front-end devs.",
    "date": "2026-07-03",
